 "description": "Boots on the alternate splash animation instead of the usual one. The intro task draws one pseudo-random number and picks between two whole animations, but the generator is never seeded, so the rare one (0.1% nominal weight) is unreachable on stock; this makes it the one you get. Nothing else changes.",
